PROJECT CRM

TARGET PHP

PROFILE CRM

USE audit.standard

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL Lead
    name STRING
    email STRING
    source STRING OPTIONAL

MODEL Customer
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE
    company STRING

MODEL Activity
    title STRING
    notes TEXT OPTIONAL

RELATION Customer HAS_MANY Activity

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE Customer.company REQUIRED

ROUTE GET /customers PROTECTED
ROUTE GET /customers/{id} PROTECTED
ROUTE POST /customers
ROUTE PATCH /customers/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /customers/{id}
ROUTE GET /customers/{id}/activities PROTECTED
ROUTE POST /activities
ROUTE GET /leads PROTECTED
ROUTE POST /leads
ROUTE GET /reports/pipeline PROTECTED
